    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to </strong><i>Starry Trace</i><strong>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing yet brain-teasing puzzle game featuring 100+ addictive levels with escalating difficulty. Ready to test your skills?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose a star, leave your mark!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap the star you want to move, but remember: you can only switch stars after clearing all from the grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fill the grid, complete the pattern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the target design within the allowed moves to win. Simple controls, but mastering it takes strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Moves</strong>: Plan carefully to solve puzzles in minimal steps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Unlocks</strong>: Beat a level to unlock the next\u2014get ready for tougher challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Mode</strong>: Enjoy fresh puzzles every time with infinite randomized stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Run</strong>: Stop the timer when you finish\u2014race against the clock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Soundtrack</strong>: Soothing BGM keeps you relaxed even during marathon sessions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support for controllers</strong>: Connect a controller, kick back, and puzzle away with ease.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Start Your Celestial Adventure Now! \ud83c\udf89</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re sharpening your mind or unwinding, <i>Starry Trace</i> delivers endless fun. Who will become the ultimate &quot;Starry Artist&quot;?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to </strong><i>Starry Trace</i><strong>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing yet brain-teasing puzzle game featuring 100+ addictive levels with escalating difficulty. Ready to test your skills?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose a star, leave your mark!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap the star you want to move, but remember: you can only switch stars after clearing all from the grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fill the grid, complete the pattern!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the target design within the allowed moves to win. Simple controls, but mastering it takes strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Moves</strong>: Plan carefully to solve puzzles in minimal steps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Unlocks</strong>: Beat a level to unlock the next\u2014get ready for tougher challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Mode</strong>: Enjoy fresh puzzles every time with infinite randomized stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Run</strong>: Stop the timer when you finish\u2014race against the clock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Soundtrack</strong>: Soothing BGM keeps you relaxed even during marathon sessions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support for controllers</strong>: Connect a controller, kick back, and puzzle away with ease.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Start Your Celestial Adventure Now! \ud83c\udf89</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re sharpening your mind or unwinding, <i>Starry Trace</i> delivers endless fun. Who will become the ultimate &quot;Starry Artist&quot;?</p>",
    "short_description": "Starry Trace is a relaxing puzzle game where players create colorful grid by strategically moving stars. Solve 100+ challenging levels with limited moves, and enjoy endless randomized puzzles. Features calming music, minimalist art, and a mix of strategy and casual play for all skill levels.",
